hunting down vampires is hard work but  someone's got to do it here's everything  you need to know about evil West  well West is an action-filled gory  fast-paced third person shooter with a  narrative driven linear campaign so it  goes without saying you'll be doing a  lot of shooting along with a healthy mix  of melee as well at Jesse's disposal are  the gauntlet a powerful melee weapon  with electrified upgraded versions that  can stun enemies or turn them into Ash  and the scorcher a flamethrower that  uses the gauntlet's energy to refuel its  tank over time there are of course also  more traditional shooter weapons such as  the institute's signature shotgun for  close range combat the revolver for  close to mid-range and the rifle for  precision and long range Bullseye each  weapon in the game has its own skill  tree so you can customize your playstyle  and learn new ways to take out the  vampires  in evil West you play as Jessie rentier  one of the last agents in a top secret  Monster hunting Institute led by your  father William this institute has been  eliminating vampiric monsters since the  early 18th century and you're one of the  most proficient unpredictable and  stubborn Hunters your trusty partner is  a senior agent by the name of Edgar  gravenor a man with his eyes on  retirement after years of helping your  father Safeguard Pioneers from threats  to the frontier another key member of  The Institute is Amelia Blackwell an  expert medic and researcher on all  things sangwa suj aka the newest blood  sucking threat  long hidden in the shadows the sangu suj  aren't your typical vampires these  monsters consist of boo hags a deadly  creature with low intelligence often  traveling in packs naggles fast  ambushers with a unique ability to avoid  small caliber gunfire with their Shadow  step bleachers massive creature with  spiky Shields that can regenerate their  defense when the shields are destroyed  and highborns the strongest of the bunch  that use their powerful Wings to deliver  devastating aerial attacks and can cause  swarms to fast to heal them and destroy  you you'll be taking all these creatures  across all the American frontier deep  Canyons abandoned towns gold mines and  old Sawmills will act as the backdrop to  your fight against evil  vampiric monsters can be pretty scary  but not to worry you don't have to take  on the threat alone evil West features  an online co-op for an entire campaign  but only the host progresses the story  both you and a friend will play as Jesse  and encounter challenges with slightly  different enemy compositions than when  playing alone  [Music]  evil West is developed by flying wild  hog a Polish Studio behind the Shadow  Warrior series this game is being  published by Focus entertainment and was  first officially announced at the 2020  game awards it was originally scheduled  for release on September 20th 2022 but  was later delayed to November during PAX  East 2022 a producer for the game told  Escapist magazine that evil West is  inspired by the combo system of the  Devil May Cry series and the third  person camera angle combat and finishers  of God of War 2018. so if you like  either of those games evil West might be  right up your alley evil West is  releasing on PS4 PS5 Xbox One Sirius XMS  and PC on November 22nd 2022 for more on  evil West including our review of the  game make sure to subscribe to GameSpot  [Applause]  foreign  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

